---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
import { LegalPage } from "@/components/site/LegalPage";
import "@/styles.css";
---

<Base
  title="Support — Lumnos — Bugalgo"
  description="Lumnos support and frequently asked questions. Get help with the Lumnos study tracker app."
  ogTitle="Support — Lumnos"
  canonical="https://bugalgo.com/products/lumnos/support/"
>
  <LegalPage
    client:load
    title="Support & FAQ"
    productName="Lumnos"
    productIconUrl="/images/products/lumnos.png"
    breadcrumbs={[
      { label: "Bugalgo", href: "/" },
      { label: "Products", href: "/products/" },
      { label: "Lumnos", href: "/products/lumnos/" },
      { label: "Support" },
    ]}
  >
    <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-6">Find answers to common questions about the Lumnos study tracker app.</p>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <details class="rounded-xl border border-border p-4 open:shadow-soft">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium text-foreground">How does Lumnos work?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Lumnos uses the Pomodoro technique to track your study sessions. Select your exam type and subjects, start the timer, and your study time is automatically recorded. View detailed statistics, charts, and weekly reports to monitor your progress.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="rounded-xl border border-border p-4 open:shadow-soft">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium text-foreground">Do I need to create an account?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">No. Lumnos works anonymously — you don't need to enter any personal information. The optional name field is stored only on your device.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="rounded-xl border border-border p-4 open:shadow-soft">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium text-foreground">Where is my data stored?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">All your study data (sessions, statistics, achievements) is stored locally on your device only. Nothing is sent to any server. This means if you uninstall the app, your data will be deleted.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="rounded-xl border border-border p-4 open:shadow-soft">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium text-foreground">Which exams are supported?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Lumnos supports exams across multiple countries: Turkey (YKS, LGS, KPSS, ALES, DGS), India (JEE, NEET, UPSC, CAT, GATE, SSC), Indonesia (UTBK, CPNS, Ujian Mandiri), and Brazil (ENEM, Vestibular, OAB, Concursos). You can also add custom subjects for any exam.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="rounded-xl border border-border p-4 open:shadow-soft">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium text-foreground">Does the timer work in the background?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Yes. The timer continues running in the background. You'll receive a notification when your study session ends. When you return to the app, the remaining time is accurately updated.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="rounded-xl border border-border p-4 open:shadow-soft">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium text-foreground">What does Lumnos Pro include?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Lumnos Pro provides an ad-free experience, 25 premium color themes, and advanced analytics features. Core features (timer, statistics, notifications) are free for all users.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="rounded-xl border border-border p-4 open:shadow-soft">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium text-foreground">How do I cancel my subscription?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Your subscription is managed through Google Play or the Apple App Store. Go to your store's subscription settings to cancel. The app itself does not process payments directly.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="rounded-xl border border-border p-4 open:shadow-soft">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium text-foreground">How do I delete my data?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">You can delete all your data by going to Settings &gt; Delete Account within the app. Alternatively, clearing app data from your device settings or uninstalling the app will permanently remove all data. To delete your Firebase anonymous account separately, contact us via email.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="rounded-xl border border-border p-4 open:shadow-soft">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium text-foreground">How do I turn off notifications?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">You can manage notification preferences in the app's Settings screen. You can also set quiet hours to avoid notifications during specific times (e.g., nighttime).</p>
      </details>

      <details class="rounded-xl border border-border p-4 open:shadow-soft">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium text-foreground">Can I change the app language?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Yes. Go to Settings &gt; Language to switch between supported languages: Turkish, English, Hindi, Indonesian, and Portuguese (Brazil). More languages will be added in future updates.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="rounded-xl border border-border p-4 open:shadow-soft">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer font-medium text-foreground">How do study plans work?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Lumnos generates personalized weekly study plans based on your exam type and selected strategy (balanced, intensive, or light). Plans distribute your subjects across the week. You can also manually edit any day's plan to fit your schedule.</p>
      </details>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/50 p-6 text-center">
      <p class="text-foreground font-medium mb-4">Didn't find your answer? Contact us:</p>
      <a href="mailto:info@lumnos.app" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-primary px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground shadow-elegant transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5">
        Send Email
      </a>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">info@lumnos.app</p>
    </div>
  </LegalPage>
</Base>
